WEBVTT

00:00:00.751 --> 00:00:07.351
Not sure how something works? The How to tab explains every part of the app, and it grows with every new feature.

00:00:07.852 --> 00:00:13.822
At the bottom you'll find Suggest a feature. Missing something? Type your idea and tap Send.

00:00:14.323 --> 00:00:19.133
Your ideas appear in a list with their status, and the organisers review each one.

00:00:19.635 --> 00:00:26.805
If they need more detail, you'll see their question here, and as a banner on the Upcoming tab. Type your answer and send it.

00:00:27.305 --> 00:00:30.865
When your idea has been built into the app, a pop-up lets you know.

00:00:31.365 --> 00:00:40.135
If an idea gets a NO GO, you see the reason. You can edit it and send it again within fifteen days. A countdown shows how many days you have left.

